(285, 1, 'owner', 'delete', 'App\\Models\\Pipeline', 244, '[LMS 1/8] Setup Server, Domain & Database', '{\"id\":244,\"category\":\"todo\",\"jenis\":null,\"account\":\"fk\",\"assigned_to\":14,\"key_result_id\":null,\"created_by\":1,\"coaching\":null,\"speaker\":null,\"endorse\":\"[LMS 1\\/8] Setup Server, Domain & Database\",\"description\":\"DESKRIPSI\\r\\nSiapkan fondasi LMS pada infrastruktur milik AIpreneur.\\r\\n\\r\\nYANG DIKERJAKAN\\r\\n- Aktifkan subdomain class.aipreneur.co.id atau academy.aipreneur.co.id beserta SSL.\\r\\n- Setup repository, staging, production, environment, dan deployment.\\r\\n- Buat database user, role, course, module, lesson, enrollment, transaction, progress, dan chat.\\r\\n- Pisahkan role Student dan Admin\\/Principal.\\r\\n- Siapkan storage thumbnail, video, PDF, dan materi; hindari public file URL yang mudah disalin.\\r\\n- Setup backup database dan error logging dasar.\\r\\n\\r\\nDONE CRITERIA\\r\\nDomain aktif HTTPS; database production terhubung; login dasar berjalan; role student\\/admin terpisah; backup dasar tersedia.\",\"progress\":\"done_ilham\",\"position\":1,\"done\":0,\"revisi\":0,\"completed_at\":null,\"tanggal_posting\":null,\"tanggal_payment\":null,\"deadline\":\"2026-08-03\",\"score\":null,\"payment_status\":\"belum\",\"amount_idr\":null,\"amount_usd\":null,\"dp1\":null,\"dp2\":null,\"dp3\":null,\"notes\":null,\"link\":null,\"kontak_wa\":null,\"kontak_gmail\":null,\"kontak_ig\":null,\"todos\":null,\"labels\":\"[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Urgent\\\",\\\"group\\\":2,\\\"color\\\":\\\"bg-red-500\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Selesai\\\",\\\"group\\\":1,\\\"color\\\":\\\"bg-emerald-500\\\"}]\",\"deleted_at\":\"2026-08-01 05:14:37\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31 05:56:38\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-01 05:14:37\",\"archived_at\":null,\"is_kr_master\":0}', '[]', '2001:448a:c0f0:4c38:a86f:df99:5c5:2e', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '2026-08-01 05:14:37'),
