(208, 'todo', NULL, 'fk', 14, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, '[PARENT] Build LMS AIpreneur Self-Hosted — MVP', 'TUJUAN\nMembangun MVP LMS AIpreneur self-hosted di domain, server, database, dan dashboard milik AIpreneur sendiri—menggantikan platform pihak ketiga.\n\nSCOPE END-TO-END\nLanding page → checkout Midtrans → validasi pembayaran → akun otomatis → onboarding email & WhatsApp → student dashboard → course player → admin/principal dashboard → community chat → QA & production launch.\n\nOUTPUT WAJIB\n1. Domain LMS aktif dengan HTTPS.\n2. Role Student dan Admin/Principal terpisah.\n3. Checkout Midtrans serta payment webhook berjalan.\n4. Pembeli otomatis memperoleh akun dan akses course setelah status paid.\n5. Student dapat menonton course dan menyimpan progress.\n6. Admin dapat mengelola course, user, transaksi, dan community.\n7. Community chat internal tersedia per course.\n8. Flow end-to-end lolos testing mobile dan desktop.\n\nDONE CRITERIA\nTidak ada critical bug pada flow pembelian sampai belajar; user tanpa pembayaran tidak dapat membuka course; student tidak dapat masuk ke admin; Midtrans production siap diaktifkan; hasil final mendapat approval Gilang/Freddie.\n\nCATATAN\nTarget 3 hari adalah MVP functional. Fitur lanjutan seperti live streaming, gamification, certificate builder, affiliate, advanced analytics, direct message, dan mobile app masuk Phase 2.', 'done_ilham', 2, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-03', NULL, 'belum', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"name\":\"Selesai\",\"group\":1,\"color\":\"bg-emerald-500\"}]', NULL, '2026-07-28 10:32:10', '2026-08-03 11:52:40', NULL, 0),
