(242, 'todo', NULL, 'fk', 14, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, '[LMS 1/8] Setup Server, Domain & Database', 'DESKRIPSI\r\nSiapkan fondasi LMS pada infrastruktur milik AIpreneur.\r\n\r\nYANG DIKERJAKAN\r\n- Aktifkan subdomain class.aipreneur.co.id atau academy.aipreneur.co.id beserta SSL.\r\n- Setup repository, staging, production, environment, dan deployment.\r\n- Buat database user, role, course, module, lesson, enrollment, transaction, progress, dan chat.\r\n- Pisahkan role Student dan Admin/Principal.\r\n- Siapkan storage thumbnail, video, PDF, dan materi; hindari public file URL yang mudah disalin.\r\n- Setup backup database dan error logging dasar.\r\n\r\nDONE CRITERIA\r\nDomain aktif HTTPS; database production terhubung; login dasar berjalan; role student/admin terpisah; backup dasar tersedia.', 'done_ilham', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-03', NULL, 'belum', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Akses Login:\nraventcreative2022@gmail.com\nraventcreative12345678', 'https://academy.aipreneur.co.id', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"name\":\"Urgent\",\"group\":2,\"color\":\"bg-red-500\"},{\"name\":\"Selesai\",\"group\":1,\"color\":\"bg-emerald-500\"}]', NULL, '2026-07-31 05:55:50', '2026-08-03 11:52:40', NULL, 0),
