(245, 'todo', NULL, 'fk', 14, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, '[LMS 2/8] UI/UX Design System AIpreneur', 'DESKRIPSI\r\nBuat UI/UX LMS dengan identitas AIpreneur/Freddie: dark premium, electric blue, clean, modern, mobile-first.\r\n\r\nHALAMAN WAJIB\r\nLanding page; login/register; student dashboard; course detail; video lesson player; community; profile/settings; admin/principal dashboard.\r\n\r\nARAH INTERFACE\r\n- Background navy-black, aksen electric blue.\r\n- Logo Freddie untuk personal branding dan logo AIpreneur untuk produk/course.\r\n- Card course mengadaptasi referensi kelas lama dengan layout lebih modern.\r\n- Navigasi student dan admin jelas serta konsisten.\r\n\r\nDONE CRITERIA\r\nSemua halaman utama memiliki wireframe/UI desktop dan mobile; design system konsisten; flow utama mudah dipahami; siap approval sebelum implementasi final.', 'done_ilham', 1, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-03', NULL, 'belum', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"name\":\"Urgent\",\"group\":2,\"color\":\"bg-red-500\"},{\"name\":\"Selesai\",\"group\":1,\"color\":\"bg-emerald-500\"}]', NULL, '2026-07-31 05:56:50', '2026-08-03 11:52:40', NULL, 0),
